  "MiniApp(name: string, title: string, description: string, children: any[]) — A reusable interactive panel inside Card. Fields are local; only an explicit AskAgent action runs inference. Give it a stable unique name.",
  "MiniInput(name: string, label: string, value: $binding<string | number | any>, kind?: \"text\" | \"number\" | \"textarea\", required?: boolean, min?: number, max?: number) — Labelled two-way $variable input. Use text, number or textarea; numeric blank is null, not zero. Text maximum 5000 characters. Use required/min/max and validate the Run button.",
